{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"636019335231569940","content":"\"seems very few people here are eager to see.... such beauty.  Been quiet today.\"","created_at":"2020-07-27T21:28:27.925000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737421171569721380","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"AlfaMuffin","id":"176404876983664640","is_bot":0,"username":"alfamuffin"},"author_id":"176404876983664640","channel_id":"636019335231569940","content":"\"It seems too few people can appreciate the mystery of nature, and seek to make their own issues\"","created_at":"2020-07-27T21:31:23.485000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737421907921731616","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"636019335231569940","content":"nods","created_at":"2020-07-27T21:32:00.165000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737422061768540210","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"AlfaMuffin","id":"176404876983664640","is_bot":0,"username":"alfamuffin"},"author_id":"176404876983664640","channel_id":"636019335231569940","content":"\"Of course, such issues might be connected to great mysteries themselves - but I always enjoyed the lure of nature\"","created_at":"2020-07-27T21:32:06.055000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737422086473121802","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"636019335231569940","content":"\"too often... people forget... they are part of nature\"","created_at":"2020-07-27T21:32:58.127000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737422304878788689","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"AlfaMuffin","id":"176404876983664640","is_bot":0,"username":"alfamuffin"},"author_id":"176404876983664640","channel_id":"636019335231569940","content":"Kyrre nods, transfixed on the view as they pass a standing coral column.","created_at":"2020-07-27T21:34:50.077000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737422774431121528","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"636019335231569940","content":"(in primordial aquan) ||\"Things like this are why I found faith in nature.  How can someone see this, and not see the divine?\"||","created_at":"2020-07-27T21:37:23.842000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737423419368275999","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"636019335231569940","content":"Goanhawe enters the observation deck. He notes everyone in the room, but ignores them.","created_at":"2020-07-27T21:40:07.195000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737424104520548395","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"AlfaMuffin","id":"176404876983664640","is_bot":0,"username":"alfamuffin"},"author_id":"176404876983664640","channel_id":"636019335231569940","content":"||\"Do you think beauty must be divine? Can it not simply be natural?\"|| Kyrre answers in kind","created_at":"2020-07-27T21:40:07.677000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737424106542333953","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"636019335231569940","content":"||\"I think the divine is it all of nature.  It is within us.  We are looking at millions of animals and plants building together as one.  Is that not what we plan to do also on our quest?  Divinity is everywhere.  Nature is divinity, Divinity is nature.  Some of us lose touch with that which is within us.\"|| grasps his emblem brienfly","created_at":"2020-07-27T21:43:09.362000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737424868584456303","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
